`the 1957 table` MEANS `the comparison table of SH 1123 under the sub-heading for the 1957 Law`

`the 1971 table of SH 1123` MEANS `the comparison table of SH 1123 under the sub-heading for the 1971 new version`

`the table of NV 19` MEANS `the comparison table of NV 19 printed page 439`

